        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b> Field Enterprises LS-35, 3\" Traditional Band Doorstop</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nConstructed of solid brass, this traditional style wall mount door stop adds a touch of sophistication to any room. It is equally suited for use in private residential or commercial applications. This Traditional Band 3 Inch Wall Mount Doorstop screws onto the baseboard casement or door bottom to protect not just the wall, but your door knob or lever as well. Choose from 6 finishes including satin nickel, oil rubbed bronze, and polished brass.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: Longer  <a href=\"/products/4-inch-traditional-wall-mount-doorstop-field-enterprises-ls-45\"><b>Traditional Band 4 Inch Wall Mount Door Stop</a></b><p>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 3 Inch Traditional Wall Mount Doorstop:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Diameter: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Bumper Tip: Black</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with all the mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
